    "The new endless producer calculates the phase before its first ordinary 3,600,000ms delay and after each delay. Ordinary delay does not set HomeRefreshDeadline; the one-shot cache branch is unreachable for this endless loop, so reactivation begins with a fresh calculation without a retained hourly deadline.",
    "The earlier Notes receipt explicitly retains a source-only Today midnight countdown issue. This phase-label calculation is distinct; the countdown source is byte-identical and no prior clock or held scope is reset.",
    "Actual root build command completed exit 0 in 133.13713587500388 seconds, including unit tests, debug/performance APK assembly, R8 and vital lint. Independently read all 475 XML files: 4,565 test cases, no failures/errors/skips. Existing clock and alarm timing tests are regression evidence for their helpers, not a new mounted moon-producer test.",
    "Independent static APK decoding confirms package.debug, 1.175/code169 and the same signer certificate as 1.174. Unique ZIP entry sets contain all 23 current source assets exactly once with exact bytes, and every source asset matches its baseline. Debug asset payloads are unchanged; only optimized baseline.prof and baseline.profm change, with retained format headers."
